<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
        <div class="logo">T</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="/index.html">Start</a>
        <a href="/about.html">Who I Am</a>
        <a href="/specialties.html" aria-current="page">Offerings</a>
        <a href="/approach.html">How I Work</a>
        <a href="/contact.html">Reach Out</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero reveal">
        <div>
          <h1>Areas of focus</h1>
          <p class="lead">Work that centers on practical skills, emotional clarity, and steady pacing. Below are common areas where I support members.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px">
          <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <button id="tryNowBtn" style="padding:8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(11,18,32,0.06);background:white">Try an exercise</button>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:16px">
        <h2>Clinical specialities</h2>
        <div class="services">
          <div class="service">
            <strong>Transitions & life changes</strong>
            <p>Support through decisions, role shifts, and endings. We create manageable next steps and practice new responses between sessions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service">
            <strong>Relationship patterns</strong>
            <p>Understand repeating dynamics, improve communication, and strengthen boundaries in close relationships.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service">
            <strong>Persistent worry & anxious states</strong>
            <p>Short-, mid-, and longer-term strategies for managing worry with attention to functioning and values.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="service">
            <strong>Adjustment after loss</strong>
            <p>Compassionate, practical support—both immediate coping and ongoing meaning-making as needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>How this is framed</h2>
        <div class="service">
          <p>Instead of fixed packages with rigid promises, I offer membership access with clearly described options. We pick a rhythm that fits your needs—regular weekly sessions, a focused plan, or occasional check-ins. The goal is to align sessions with your real life and priorities.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>Boundaries and safety</h2>
        <div class="service">
          <p>Conversations are confidential within ethical and legal limits. I will clarify what I can and cannot provide; when concerns fall outside my scope I will discuss referrals. If you are in crisis or need immediate help, please contact emergency services or a crisis line; therapy by appointment does not replace urgent care.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>Have a question?</h2>
        <div class="service">
          <p>If you are wondering whether I take your insurance, how messaging works between visits, or what membership means in practice, please reach out—an initial consult can answer specifics and help you decide if this is a good fit.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:10px"><a href="/contact.html">Contact</a> • <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>Licensed clinician • Confidential care • Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Scroll reveal with prefer-reduced-motion respect
    (function(){
      var reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      if(reduced){ document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(function(el){el.classList.add('visible')}); return; }
      var io = new IntersectionObserver(function(entries){ entries.forEach(function(e){ if(e.isIntersecting){ e.target.classList.add('visible'); io.unobserve(e.target); } }); },{threshold:0.14});
      document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(function(el){ io.observe(el); });
    })();

    // Reuse guided exercise modal from other pages (lightweight inline implementation)
    (function(){
      var tryBtn = document.getElementById('tryNowBtn');
      if(!tryBtn) return;
      tryBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
        // Create a minimal inline breathing prompt
        var el = document.createElement('div'); el.style.position='fixed'; el.style.inset='0'; el.style.background='rgba(2,6,23,0.45)'; el.style.display='grid'; el.style.placeItems='center'; el.style.zIndex=9999;
        var box = document.createElement('div'); box.style.background='white'; box.style.padding='18px'; box.style.borderRadius='12px'; box.style.maxWidth='560px'; box.style.width='92%';
        var h = document.createElement('h3'); h.textContent='Breathing exercise';
        var p = document.createElement('p'); p.textContent='Follow a slow 4-4 pattern for three rounds. Breathe in for 4, hold briefly, breathe out for 4.';
        var close = document.createElement('button'); close.textContent='Close'; close.style.marginTop='10px'; close.className='btn';
        close.addEventListener('click',function(){ document.body.removeChild(el); });
        var circle = document.createElement('div'); circle.style.width='120px'; circle.style.height='120px'; circle.style.borderRadius='50%'; circle.style.margin='8px auto'; circle.style.background='linear-gradient(180deg,#2baf6f,#bfffe2)'; circle.style.animation='expand-contract 4s ease-in-out infinite';
        box.appendChild(h); box.appendChild(p); box.appendChild(circle); box.appendChild(close); el.appendChild(box); document.body.appendChild(el);
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>How I Work — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--accent:#ff7a59;--muted:#666;--bg:#f7fbff;--card:#fff}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:#071029;background:var(--bg)}
    .site{max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:20px}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff7a59,#ffc39e);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:12px;text-decoration:none;color:#071029}

    .hero{padding:18px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,122,89,0.06),transparent);display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    h1{margin:0}
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition:opacity 420ms ease,transform 420ms ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.reveal{transition:none;opacity:1;transform:none}}

    .process{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:16px}
    .step{background:var(--card);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(10,12,20,0.04)}
    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:8px}
    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site">
    <header>
      <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px">
        <div class="logo">T</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="/index.html">Start</a>
        <a href="/about.html">Who I Am</a>
        <a href="/specialties.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="/approach.html" aria-current="page">How I Work</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Schedule</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero reveal">
        <div>
          <h1>Practical, collaborative care</h1>
          <p class="meta">I partner with you to develop clear steps and tools you can use between sessions. Therapy is a shared process: I bring clinical training and you bring lived experience.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-left:auto">
          <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal process" aria-label="Therapy process">
        <div class="step">
          <strong>1. Intake & priorities</strong>
          <p>We map current concerns, health context, and what you hope to shift. This sets the scope and frequency that make sense for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <strong>2. Collaborative plan</strong>
          <p>Together we identify achievable goals, short practices, and ways to notice progress even when change is gradual.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <strong>3. Review and adapt</strong>
          <p>Every few sessions we check in on how the plan is working and adapt—no rigid timelines, only shared decisions about next steps.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>Therapeutic orientation</h2>
        <div class="step">
          <p>I draw from cognitive-behavioral strategies, acceptance-based work, and relational insights—selecting what fits a person’s situation. My approach is collaborative, curious, and oriented toward practical change rather than labels.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="reveal" style="margin-top:18px">
        <h2>Membership and access</h2>
        <div class="step">
          <p>Membership offers predictable access and a clear way to plan support over time. Options include regular weekly sessions, a focused short plan, or a lighter check-in arrangement for ongoing members.</p>
          <p class="meta">Pricing and details are discussed during an initial consultation.</p>
